%%% note
Salesforce コネクタの Bulk / メタデータ API の操作の headers。d30 の org。
Bulk v1 (create-job): HTTP ヘッダとして送る。Sforce-Enable-PKChunking の chunkSize が大きすぎると Salesforce が断る。値は toString、null は送らない。
PK chunking を付けた query のジョブでは、元のバッチが NotProcessed になり、分けたバッチが足される。
実コネクタは create-job などの POST で付けたヘッダを、使い回す接続に残す (後の POST にも付く。mulay は持ち越さない)。
その違いが出ないように、chunkSize の大きすぎる要求は v1 の最後に置く。
Bulk v2 (create-query-job、create-job-bulk-api-v2): 最初の POST にだけ付き、既定の Content-Type を上書きする。文字列でない値は ClassCastException。
/v2/query は中断の後、ジョブが終わるのを待ってから消す (中断を受け付けても終わるまで消せず "job is not terminated" になるため)。
メタデータ: 実コネクタは partner のヘッダのクラスを MetadataConnection に渡せず、どのヘッダも送らない (ログに出すだけ)。AllOrNoneHeader を付けても、成功する行は保存される。
%%% requires src/main/resources/sf-secret.yaml
%%% port 18565
%%% request POST /reset
%%% response 200
content-type: application/json; charset=UTF-8

{
  "ok": true
}
%%% request POST /v1/pk?mode=none
%%% response 200
content-type: application/json; charset=UTF-8

{
  "state": "Completed",
  "batches": false
}
%%% request POST /v1/job?mode=none
%%% response 200
content-type: application/json; charset=UTF-8

{
  "created": "Open",
  "after": "Aborted"
}
%%% request POST /v1/job?mode=chunktrue
%%% response 200
content-type: application/json; charset=UTF-8

{
  "created": "Open",
  "after": "Aborted"
}
%%% request POST /v1/job?mode=chunknull
%%% response 200
content-type: application/json; charset=UTF-8

{
  "created": "Open",
  "after": "Aborted"
}
%%% request POST /v1/job?mode=mapval
%%% response 200
content-type: application/json; charset=UTF-8

{
  "created": "Open",
  "after": "Aborted"
}
%%% request POST /v1/job?mode=intval
%%% response 200
content-type: application/json; charset=UTF-8

{
  "created": "Open",
  "after": "Aborted"
}
%%% request POST /v1/pk?mode=chunktrue
%%% response 200
content-type: application/json; charset=UTF-8

{
  "state": "NotProcessed",
  "batches": true
}
%%% request POST /v1/job?mode=chunkbad
%%% response 200
content-type: application/json; charset=UTF-8

{
  "error": "SALESFORCE:INVALID_INPUT",
  "description": "ClientInputError"
}
%%% request POST /v1/job-child
%%% response 200
content-type: application/json; charset=UTF-8

{
  "error": "SALESFORCE:INVALID_INPUT",
  "description": "ClientInputError"
}
%%% request POST /v2/query?mode=none
%%% response 200
content-type: application/json; charset=UTF-8

{
  "operation": "query",
  "object": "Account"
}
%%% request POST /v2/query?mode=xmlct
%%% response 200
content-type: application/json; charset=UTF-8

{
  "error": "SALESFORCE:INVALID_INPUT",
  "description": "Invalid status code: 400, response body: [{\"errorCode\":\"API_ERROR\",\"message\":\"Content is not allowed in prolog.\"}]"
}
%%% request POST /v2/query?mode=calloptions
%%% response 200
content-type: application/json; charset=UTF-8

{
  "operation": "query",
  "object": "Account"
}
%%% request POST /v2/query?mode=intval
%%% response 200
content-type: application/json; charset=UTF-8

{
  "error": "MULE:UNKNOWN",
  "description": "class java.lang.Integer cannot be cast to class java.lang.String (java.lang.Integer and java.lang.String are in module java.base of loader 'bootstrap')"
}
%%% request POST /v2/query?mode=nullval
%%% response 200
content-type: application/json; charset=UTF-8

{
  "operation": "query",
  "object": "Account"
}
%%% request POST /v2/query?mode=mapval
%%% response 200
content-type: application/json; charset=UTF-8

{
  "error": "MULE:UNKNOWN",
  "description": "class java.util.LinkedHashMap cannot be cast to class java.lang.String (java.util.LinkedHashMap and java.lang.String are in module java.base of loader 'bootstrap')"
}
%%% request POST /v2/ingest?mode=xmlct
%%% response 200
content-type: application/json; charset=UTF-8

{
  "error": "SALESFORCE:INVALID_INPUT",
  "description": "Invalid status code: 400, response body: [{\"errorCode\":\"API_ERROR\",\"message\":\"Content is not allowed in prolog.\"}]"
}
%%% request POST /v2/ingest?mode=intval
%%% response 200
content-type: application/json; charset=UTF-8

{
  "error": "MULE:UNKNOWN",
  "description": "class java.lang.Integer cannot be cast to class java.lang.String (java.lang.Integer and java.lang.String are in module java.base of loader 'bootstrap')"
}
%%% request POST /meta?mode=none
%%% response 200
content-type: application/json; charset=UTF-8

{
  "items": [
    {
      "fullName": "MulayHdr1",
      "success": true
    },
    {
      "fullName": "MulayHdr2",
      "success": false
    }
  ],
  "found": [
    "MulayHdr1"
  ]
}
